CORE
test.json

^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^int func\(int x\)$
^  unsigned int x\$1;$
--
^  unsigned int x;$
--
Regression test for #6268: a symtab2gb-imported symbol table whose identifiers
lack the function:: scoping convention (here the parameter "1_x" and the local
"2_x", both with base name "x"). goto-instrument --dump-c must rename the
colliding local so the emitted C is valid; the chain recompiles the dump with
goto-cc and the patterns assert the local no longer shares the parameter name.
